<html>
<title>Copy</title>
<body>


<h1>Copy</h1>

<p>
To copy memory values within the CPU or video memory space, use the <strong>Copy</strong> button (1) shown below.
</p>

<p>
<img src="images/dump_copy.png" border="0" width="724" height="609">
</p>
<ul>
<li>(1) <strong>Copy</strong> button</li>
<li>(2) Source <strong>Start address</strong> text field</li>
<li>(3) Source <strong>End address</strong> text field</li>
<li>(4) Destination <strong>Start address</strong> text field</li>
</ul>

<p>
First, specify the <strong>Start address</strong> (2) and <strong>End address</strong> (3) of the source and the <strong>Start address</strong> (4) of the destination, all in hexadecimal.
</p>
</body>
</html>